  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      171.57,
      227.69,
      392.11,
      251.39
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE INSTITUTE OF PERSONNEL MANAGEMENT,SRI LANKA LAW, NO. 24 OF 1976",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      264.65,
      401.9,
      312.83
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the members of the Institute of PersonnelManagement, Sri Lanka, incorporated by the institute ofPersonnel Management, Sri Lanka Law, No. 24 of 1976 havepassed a resolution to amend its name :",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      326.09,
      401.91,
      374.39
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Institute of Personnel Management,Sri Lanka has applied to amend its name in order to giveeffect to such resolution, it will be expedient to grant suchapplication:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      387.65,
      401.89,
      411.23
    ],
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE be it enacted by the Parliament of theDemocratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      424.49,
      401.89,
      448.19
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Institute of PersonnelManagement, Sri Lanka (Amendment) Act, No. of 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      461.45,
      401.9,
      534.23
    ],
    "text": "2.(1) The Institute of Personnel Management, Sri LankaLaw, No. 24 of 1976 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended by the substitution for thewords \u201cInstitute of Personnel Management, Sri Lanka\u201dwherever they appear in the principal enactment of the words\u201cChartered Institute of Personnel Management, Sri Lanka\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      547.49,
      401.89,
      595.79
    ],
    "text": "(2) In any written law, there shall be substituted for thewords \u201cInstitute of Personnel Management, Sri Lanka\u201d of thewords \u201cChartered Institute of Personnel Management,Sri Lanka\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      609.05,
      401.9,
      669.59
    ],
    "text": "(3) Every reference to the \u201cInstitute of PersonnelManagement, Sri Lanka\u201d in any notice, contract,communication or other document shall be read andconstrued as a reference to the \u201cChartered Institute ofPersonnel Management, Sri Lanka\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      425.59,
      443.86,
      434.66
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
