      274.31
    ],
    "text": "3.Any power exercised, duty or function performed bythe Institute of Personnel Management, Sri Lanka prior tothe date of commencement of this Act in pursuance of anypower conferred on it by the principal enactment shall bedeemed for all purposes to have been validly exercised andperformed.",
